              format is not yet stable enough to commit to as a public shape.")

(f/candidate :trace_decision_chain
  :label   "trace_decision_chain"
  :cluster :cluster-d
  :added   "2026-06-09"
  :status  :proposed
  :scores  {:feasibility 4 :elegance 9 :containment 6 :value 7}
  :rationale "Navigate the decision graph: given a decision, trace backward to
              the open questions and assets that motivated it, and forward to
              decisions and modules it influenced. The .cnj history as a
              traversable DAG — the most Conjurer-native idea here, since the
              spec is already a decision graph. Deferred: requires building the
